---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Site title="认识柠柠，一个连接两端的小伙伴">
  <section class="page-heading"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">MEET NINGNING</p><h1>你好呀，我是柠柠。</h1><p>一瓣连着一瓣，小小的笑脸。一位从多端协作里长出来的青柠伙伴。</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand-intro"><img src="/images/02-logo-sunburst.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt="柠柠的平面标志与同形立体摆件" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">SMALL SHAPE, MANY POSSIBILITIES</p><h2>认得出，<br/>也亲近得起来。</h2><p>相连的双瓣、深绿的小叶片、低位的笑脸和两只短脚。我们希望同一个轮廓，既能留在手机和电脑的小图标里，也能走到桌面、贴纸与未来的硬件上。</p><p>“柠柠”是这一版角色的工作名。形象与产品会继续打磨，感谢你在它刚刚萌芽的时候认识它。</p></div></div>
    <div class="brand-board"><div class="brand-tile"><img src="/brand/mark-color.svg" width="140" height="140" alt="青柠与深绿双色标志"/><span>标准双色</span></div><div class="brand-tile"><img src="/brand/mark-mono.svg" width="140" height="140" alt="深林绿单色标志"/><span>单色轮廓</span></div><div class="brand-tile dark"><img src="/brand/mark-inverse.svg" width="140" height="140" alt="米白反白标志"/><span>深色背景</span></div></div>
    <div class="color-samples"><div class="swatch-lime">Lime · 青柠<br/>#A8D85D</div><div class="swatch-forest">Forest · 深林绿<br/>#263D2C</div><div class="swatch-cream">Cream · 米白<br/>#F7F8EF</div></div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/brand/limelink-brand-kit.zip" download>下载品牌资源包 <Icon name="download" size={17}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/docs/brand/vi-spec/">阅读 VI 规范 <Icon name="up" size={16}/></a></div>
    <p class="resource-note">资源包包含双色 / 单色 / 反白 SVG、透明 PNG、四端图标与配色。角色与名称尚未冻结；字体、商标与商业物料需按实际使用场景核验。</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM PIXELS TO SOMETHING YOU CAN HOLD</p><h2>从屏幕，慢慢来到身边。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/scenes/?filter=brand">看更多品牌设计 <Icon name="up" size={17}/></a></div><div class="gallery-grid"><figure><img src="/images/08-vi-stationery.webp" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="LimeLink 包装、卡片、贴纸、笔记本与挂绳的 VI 概念"/><figcaption>品牌应用概念</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/09-physical-merch.webp" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="柠柠的毛绒、硅胶摆件、徽章、钥匙扣与贴纸物化设计"/><figcaption>周边外观概念 · 尚未生产或售卖</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
</Site>
